{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"22119bcebbf291618307759c2e882a027ddc83c5ffa69a805a937dc20ae4ec6b","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["預言審判泰爾王"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你去告訴泰爾王，主耶和華這樣說，",{"text":"「『你心裡高傲，說，我是神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我坐在海中神明的寶座上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你雖然自以為像神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你不過是人，並非神明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，你比但以理更有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"什麼秘密都瞞不過你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你憑智慧和頭腦發了財，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金銀裝滿了你的庫房。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你靠高超的經商本領使財富大增，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因而變得心高氣傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，主耶和華說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你自以為像神明，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使列國中最殘暴的外族人來攻打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必拔刀毀壞你憑智慧得來的美物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玷污你的榮美，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你墜入墳墓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必慘死在大海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在殺戮你的人面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你還能自稱為神明嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在殺你的人手中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不過是人，並非神明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要像未受割禮的人那樣死在外族人手中。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我已經宣告，這是主耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["泰爾王的終局"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「人子啊，你要為泰爾王唱哀歌，告訴他，主耶和華這樣說，",{"text":"「『你曾經是完美的典範，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"充滿智慧，美麗無瑕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾在上帝的伊甸園中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾佩戴各種寶石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有紅寶石、黃玉、鑽石、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"綠寶石、紅瑪瑙、碧玉、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藍寶石、綠松石、翡翠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底座鑲嵌著精美的黃金，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些在你受造的那天都已經預備妥當。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我膏立你為看守約櫃的基路伯天使。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我把你安置在上帝的聖山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在閃閃發光的寶石中行走。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你從受造那天開始所行的純全無過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但後來在你那裡查出不義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為貿易發達，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你便充滿暴力，犯罪作惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，看守約櫃的基路伯天使啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我把你當作污穢之物逐出上帝的山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從閃閃發光的寶石中除掉你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你因俊美而心高氣傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因輝煌而心智敗壞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我把你扔到地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓你在列國的君王面前出醜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你多行不義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"交易不公，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"褻瀆了你的聖所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我使火在你那裡燃起，吞噬你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在眾目睽睽之下把你燒成地上的灰燼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有認識你的民族都因你而驚駭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你落得可怕的下場，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你將永遠不復存在。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["預言審判西頓"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["耶和華對我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["「人子啊，你要面對西頓，說預言斥責她，"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["告訴她，主耶和華這樣說，",{"text":"「『西頓啊，我要與你為敵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在你那裡彰顯我的榮耀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要審判你，在你中間彰顯我的聖潔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，人們就知道我是耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使瘟疫進入你境內，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀劍從四面八方臨到你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被殺的人橫屍城中，血流街頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣人們就知道我是耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["「『藐視以色列人的鄰邦必不再作刺他們的荊棘，傷他們的蒺藜，這樣人們就知道我是主耶和華。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["「主耶和華說，『我要把分散到列國的以色列人招聚起來，當著列國的面在他們身上彰顯我的聖潔，那時他們要住在自己的土地上，就是我賜給我僕人雅各的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["他們將在那裡安然居住，興建房屋，栽種葡萄園。我審判鄙視他們的四鄰後，他們必安然居住。這樣，他們便知道我是他們的上帝耶和華。』」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZK/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}